        "titulo": "Strong participles of group 2: the vowel changes",
        "explicacao": "STEP 1: in GROUP 2, the vowel of the stem CHANGES in the participle, which still ends in «-en». STEP 2: there are patterns that help: i → u (trinken → getrunken, finden → gefunden, singen → gesungen); ei → ie (schreiben → geschrieben, bleiben → geblieben); e → o (sprechen → gesprochen, helfen → geholfen, nehmen → genommen, treffen → getroffen, beginnen → begonnen). STEP 3: «beginnen» has an inseparable prefix (be-): no «ge-»: begonnen. STEP 4: there is no absolute rule: use the patterns as a help and memorise the pairs together with the infinitive. STEP 5: all of these use «haben», except «bleiben», which uses «sein».",
